Objective Metric:
• Partner with the main MGF Managers (CFO FR, MBS-T, MBS HR and MBS B&P) and the MBS Transformation Managers in defining headcount reduction targets, target operating model and project phases. Actively identify roadblocks and propose solutions;
• Design the appropriate HR approach for each impacted unit, that will ensure a fair treatment for each concerned employee while enabling MBS strategy roll out and optimizing related costs for the Company;
• Coordinate all efforts related to the presentation and discussions with WCs: prepare business cases, people analytics, financial impacts and social measures, …
• Consult CFO FR and MBS Managers in setting key messages and support them in delivering them thru townhalls or individual meetings with employees;
• Act a catalyzer for any HR related questions, identify solutions and ensure appropriate implementation of the social measures to contribute to the strategy roll out while ensuring business continuity
• Continue to identify redeployment opportunities to proactively reduce future potential redundancies.

