Objective Comment:
1. lead the UTCB closure project from HR perspective, worked out the detailed people plan & communication strategy;  worked closely with GHRBP, business leader, MBS, COE, internal & external lawyer, to get alignment, & mitigate legal risk;
2. so far all the EEs had signed mutual agreements unless 5 will stay till Q1 2019; no unilateral termination occurred;
3. took this opportunity to build strong relationship with site head, coached him on building trust with his mgr;

- In addition to H1 comments;
- GSA team review process (see H1 comments) has provided a basis for developing the leadership team in the comming months as well as provided a mechanims for discussion some important strategic and messaging topics (including the value proposition for the team, 'why' it makes sense for GSA and distributors to be in the same team and balancing the potential conflict implicit in this organiational set up).
- Various presentations given to sub team on IDPs and developement tools (when, how to acces etc).

