Objective Description:
1. Get to know in depth the org-mechanism in wider Merck structure, PM and HR community; 
2. Establish working network and accumulate know-how of this organization to develop holistic view of how decision is made at top and how to effectively influce others at various level;
3. Enhance coaching ability esp. when interacting with senior business stakeholders; Grow courage when facing difficult conversation to strive for win-win solution.

Further forster development of organizations thru using own impact without "steering" others too much (rather influencing);
drive change (both PM-OS and PM-OQ) by delivering and designing innovative HR Solutions;
adapt own working style to Partners and their needs/style;

- Obtain fluent proficiency in spoken and written English;
- Express ideas and opinions clearly and precisely
- Improve english listening

